In order to confirm that HydrAMP is able to suggest new, active AMP peptides when using the unconstrained generation we tested to what degree the generated peptides match appropriate criteria (Fig. 4e). For that, we generated 50,000 candidate peptides and run three experiments confirming their properties. First, we computed the fraction of such peptides p which had high probability of being AMP \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
